<title>USA: Redbook sales said up 0.6 pct w/e April 12 - sources. [CORRECTED 19:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Redbook sales said up 0.6 pct w/e April 12 - sources. [CORRECTED 19:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Redbook Retail Sales Index is expected to rise 0.6 percent in the period ending April 12 after the 0.2 percent rise reported last week, according to market sources.</p>
<p>(Corrects size of last week's rise from 0.5 percent).</p>
<p>Lynch, Jones &amp; Ryan Inc will report the Redbook Index later on Tuesday at 1455EDT/1855 GMT.</p>
<p>((-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
</text>
